Pedro-TMAI Revived
A Windows continuation of PedroAI, the Trackmania AI open-sourced by trackmania.ai
(https://github.com/trackmania-ai). Work resumed on October 15, 2026.

This project includes and modifies software from the trackmania-ai project:
public-tmenv, public-tmlearn and public-op-aitool, Copyright trackmania.ai, licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE). Their original history is kept in this
repository's git history; the modifications are listed in README.md ("What changed from
upstream") and recorded in the commits made since October 15, 2026.

public-tmenv/tmenv/gbx-to-json/GbxToJson is the unchanged upstream binary built on GBX.NET
(https://github.com/BigBang1112/gbx-net). On Windows its managed assemblies are extracted
from it at first use; they are not redistributed separately in this repository.
